<title>PAKISTAN: Adamjee Insurance net 19 pct up.</title>
<headline>Adamjee Insurance net 19 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	  295 vs 274</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	   221 vs 186</p>
<p>Interim dividend paid 15 pct vs  15 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>    Final dividend	  20 pct vs  20 pct</p>
<p>    Bonus stocks	    25 pct vs  25 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Adamjee Insurance Co Ltd. It carried forward 222 million unappropriated profit vs 187 million to the balance sheet. Book closure June 17 to July 1. AGM on June 28.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
